# docs/examples/two-receivers-one-machine: both receivers running at once. The first hears the
# bench's stand-in for M0LTE through pdn-soundmodem. The second is on its own sound card,
# waiting for G8BPQ on QO-100, which nothing sends here: its decoding is the qo100-head-end
# scenario's business, and here it only has to run alongside without getting in the way.
RX_SOUNDMODEM=$X/two-receivers-one-machine/soundmodem.json
RECEIVER=$X/two-receivers-one-machine/receiver.json
RECEIVER2=$X/two-receivers-one-machine/receiver-qo100.json
RECEIVER2_STATIONS=$X/two-receivers-one-machine/stations-qo100.json
AIR="--tx $R/tx.out@7052300 --rx $R/rx.in@7052000"
